        <ui:Label text="Byren-Haber, S. (2019, September 16). Dark: UI themes are new and cool – but are they accessible?. Sheri Byrne-Haber – Multi-Award Winning Values-Based Engineering, Accessibility, And Inclusion Leader. https://www.sheribyrnehaber.com/dark-ui-themes-are-new-and-cool-but-are-they-accessible/&#10;&#10;Clyde. (2023, March 16). Now in Nitro: Bring Your Vibe to Discord with New Themes. Discord. https://discord.com/blog/bring-your-vibe-to-discord-with-new-themes-in-nitro&#10;&#10;Interaction Design Foundation - IxDF. (2021, December 9). What is Dark Mode?. Interaction Design Foundation - IxDF. https://www.interaction-design.org/literature/topics/dark-mode&#10;&#10;Lewis, Veronica. (2020, June). Light mode vs Dark Mode for Low Vision. Perkins School for the Blind. https://www.perkins.org/resource/dark-mode-for-low-vision/&#10;&#10;Walter, S. (2024, May 14). Dark mode &amp; accessibility myth. Stéphanie Walter - Senior UX Designer, Mobile Expert, Conference Speaker, Blog Writer and Teacher. https://stephaniewalter.design/blog/dark-mode-accessibility-myth-debunked/&#10;&#10;Sengsoon, P., &amp; Intaruk, R. (2025). Immediate Effects of Light Mode and Dark Mode Features on Visual Fatigue in Tablet Users. International Journal of Environmental Research and Public Health, 22(4), 609. https://doi.org/10.3390/ijerph22040609 &#10;&#10;Kim, K., Erickson, A., Lambert, A., Bruder, G., &amp; F. Welch, G. (2019). Effects of Dark Mode on Visual Fatigue and Acuity in Optical See-Through Head-Mounted Displays. https://www.researchgate.net/publication/336569145_Effects_of_Dark_Mode_on_Visual_Fatigue_and_Acuity_in_Optical_See-Through_Head-Mounted_Displays &#10;&#10;Löffler, D., Giron, L., Hurtienne, J. (2017). Night Mode, Dark Thoughts: Background Color Influences the Perceived Sentiment of Chat Messages. In: Bernhaupt, R., Dalvi, G., Joshi, A., K. Balkrishan, D., O&apos;Neill, J., Winckler, M. (eds) Human-Computer Interaction - INTERACT 2017. INTERACT 2017. Lecture Notes in Computer Science(), vol 10514. Springer, Cham. https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-67684-5_12&#10;&#10;Anna Steidle, Lioba Werth, In the spotlight: Brightness increases self-awareness and reflective self-regulation, Journal of Environmental Psychology, Volume 39, 2014, Pages 40-50,ISSN 0272-4944, https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jenvp.2013.12.007&#10;&#10;Atsani, M. A., Mukaromah, A., &amp; Anugerah, R. C. (2023). The Role of Color in User Experience: A Systematic Literature Study of User Preferences for Dark and Light Mode. https://ejournal.uinsaizu.ac.id/index.php/tids/article/view/13903&#10;&#10;Chen, J., et al. (2023). Text Readability of Smartphone in Dark Mode: Effects of Font Type, Font Weight and Color. https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-031-34866-2_2&#10;&#10;Kim, K. H., Kim, J. Y., Lee, S., &amp; Lee, B. (2019). Effects of Dark Mode on Visual Fatigue and Acuity in Optical See-Through Head-Mounted Displays. https://doi.org/10.3390/s19020319&#10;&#10;Pathari, M., Nielsen, S., Andersen, M., &amp; Marentakis, G. (2024). Dark vs. Light Mode on Smartphones: Effects on Eye Fatigue. ACHI 2024. https://personales.upv.es/thinkmind/ACHI/ACHI_2024/achi_2024_3_150_20069.html&#10;&#10;Sengsoon, N., &amp; Intaruk, T. (2025). Immediate Effects of Light Mode and Dark Mode Features on Visual Fatigue in Tablet Users.https://www.mdpi.com/1660-4601/22/4/609&#10;&#10;Francisc Aknai. (2019). Dark UI and how it can influence us emotionally - a designer POV https://uxdesign.cc/dark-ui-and-how-it-can-influence-us-emotionally-a-designer-pov-607e19bbaa6f &#10;&#10;Luka Koning, Marianne Junger (2021). Dark user interface, dark behavior? The effect of ‘dark mode’ on honesty. https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2451958821000555 &#10;&#10;Dorik Editorial Team (2025). Trending Dark Mode Website Examples in 2025 https://dorik.com/blog/dark-mode-website-examples " class="body transition-base identifier-dark-text" style="-unity-text-align: upper-left; font-size: 14px;" />
